# Synthetic test score: one voice, a stepped sweep on a D/A channel, a gate pulse loop.
# Written by hand for the validator and compiler tests. Not based on any recording.
score: 1
title: Test stepped sweep
status: draft-hidden
origin: synthetic
kind: test
tick: 1ms
voices: 1

@0     note  v0  C3
@0     cv    d8  0.00V
@0     ramp  d8  5.00V  steps 20  over 500   # the program writes 20 stepped values
@500   trig  g8
+250   off   v0
@1000  end
